msgstr "e.g. 1234 or STOCK_QTY"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-dashboard.php:1830
msgid ""
"The ID or code of one product-level custom feature holding the stock "
"quantity. Leave empty to turn the mapping off and manage stock in "
"WooCommerce as before. When a product has no value for this feature, its "
"current stock is left untouched — never set to 0 and never switched to "
"unmanaged. Trade-item level features are not used."
msgstr ""
"The ID or code of one product-level custom feature holding the stock "
"quantity. Leave empty to turn the mapping off and manage stock in "
"WooCommerce as before. When a product has no value for this feature, its "
"current stock is left untouched — never set to 0 and never switched to "
"unmanaged. Trade-item level features are not used."

